{"sectionId":"statistics/stats","items":[{"id":"statistics--stats-k001","sectionId":"statistics/stats","unitId":"statistics","subject":"statistics","text":"평균은 관측값의 합을 수로 나눈 값이고 중앙값은 정렬된 자료의 가운데 위치다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"statistics--stats-k002","sectionId":"statistics/stats","unitId":"statistics","subject":"statistics","text":"표본분산의 대표 정의는 s²=Σ(xᵢ−x̄)²/(n−1)이고 표준편차는 그 제곱근이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"statistics--stats-k003","sectionId":"statistics/stats","unitId":"statistics","subject":"statistics","text":"평균의 표준오차는 독립 동일분포 표본에서 s/√n으로 추정한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"statistics--stats-k004","sectionId":"statistics/stats","unitId":"statistics","subject":"statistics","text":"조건부확률 P(A|B)=P(A∩B)/P(B), Bayes 정리는 사전확률과 조건부 우도로 사후확률을 계산한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"statistics--stats-k005","sectionId":"statistics/stats","unitId":"statistics","subject":"statistics","text":"독립 사건이면 교집합 확률이 곱이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"statistics--stats-k006","sectionId":"statistics/stats","unitId":"statistics","subject":"statistics","text":"이항분포 X~Bin(n,p)의 평균은 np, 분산은 np(1−p)이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"statistics--stats-k007","sectionId":"statistics/stats","unitId":"statistics","subject":"statistics","text":"정규분포 표준화 z=(x−μ)/σ를 사용한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"statistics--stats-k008","sectionId":"statistics/stats","unitId":"statistics","subject":"statistics","text":"가설검정의 p값은 귀무가설 및 모형이 참일 때 관측값만큼 또는 더 극단적인 검정통계량을 얻을 확률이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"statistics--stats-k009","sectionId":"statistics/stats","unitId":"statistics","subject":"statistics","text":"이는 귀무가설이 참일 확률이 아니다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"statistics--stats-k010","sectionId":"statistics/stats","unitId":"statistics","subject":"statistics","text":"제I종 오류는 참인 귀무가설을 기각하는 오류, 제II종 오류는 거짓 귀무가설을 기각하지 못하는 오류다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"statistics--stats-k011","sectionId":"statistics/stats","unitId":"statistics","subject":"statistics","text":"검정력=1−β이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"statistics--stats-k012","sectionId":"statistics/stats","unitId":"statistics","subject":"statistics","text":"신뢰구간 해석은 반복 표집 절차의 포함률을 기준으로 한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"statistics--stats-k013","sectionId":"statistics/stats","unitId":"statistics","subject":"statistics","text":"SD는 자료 산포, SE는 추정량 불확실성.","kind":"highlight","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"statistics--stats-k014","sectionId":"statistics/stats","unitId":"statistics","subject":"statistics","text":"민감도=P(양성","kind":"highlight","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"statistics--stats-k015","sectionId":"statistics/stats","unitId":"statistics","subject":"statistics","text":"질병), 특이도=P(음성","kind":"highlight","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"statistics--stats-k016","sectionId":"statistics/stats","unitId":"statistics","subject":"statistics","text":"비질병).","kind":"highlight","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"statistics--stats-k017","sectionId":"statistics/stats","unitId":"statistics","subject":"statistics","text":"양성예측도는 유병률에 영향을 받는다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"statistics--stats-k018","sectionId":"statistics/stats","unitId":"statistics","subject":"statistics","text":"상관관계는 인과관계를 증명하지 않는다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]},{"id":"statistics--stats-k019","sectionId":"statistics/stats","unitId":"statistics","subject":"statistics","text":"절반이 된다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"historical-or-supplementary","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":[]}]}